vas:Normalized_Difference_Water_Index a resource:Soil_Property,
                                        owl:NamedIndividual;
                                      rdfs:comment """NDWI – Normalized Difference Water Index
Estimates leaf water content and moisture conditions using narrowband reflectance in the NIR and SWIR (or Green–NIR). It is sensitive to vegetation water status and widely used in stress detection."""@en;
                                      rdfs:label "NDWI"@en;
                                      sosa:isObservedBy vas:NRI_UAV_Hyperspectral_Sensor_1.
